{"actions":[{"actionCode":"H11100","actionDate":"2025-09-02","source":"House floor actions","text":"Referred to the House Committee on Agriculture.","type":"IntroReferral"},{"actionCode":"Intro-H","actionDate":"2025-09-02","source":"Library of Congress","text":"Introduced in House","type":"IntroReferral"},{"actionCode":"1000","actionDate":"2025-09-02","source":"Library of Congress","text":"Introduced in House","type":"IntroReferral"}],"congress":119,"congressGovUrl":"https://www.congress.gov/bill/119th-congress/house-bill/5097","cosponsors":[{"bioguideId":"C001059","fullName":"Rep. Costa, Jim [D-CA-21]","isOriginalCosponsor":true,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2025-09-02","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"CA"},{"bioguideId":"B001285","fullName":"Rep. Brownley, Julia [D-CA-26]","isOriginalCosponsor":true,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2025-09-02","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"CA"},{"bioguideId":"P000613","fullName":"Rep. Panetta, Jimmy [D-CA-19]","isOriginalCosponsor":true,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2025-09-02","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"CA"},{"bioguideId":"L000578","fullName":"Rep. LaMalfa, Doug [R-CA-1]","isOriginalCosponsor":true,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-09-02","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"CA"},{"bioguideId":"H001090","fullName":"Rep. Harder, Josh [D-CA-9]","isOriginalCosponsor":true,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2025-09-02","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"CA"},{"bioguideId":"V000138","fullName":"Rep. Vindman, Eugene Simon [D-VA-7]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2025-09-15","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"VA"},{"bioguideId":"G000605","fullName":"Rep. Gray, Adam [D-CA-13]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2025-12-02","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"CA"},{"bioguideId":"S001226","fullName":"Rep. Salinas, Andrea [D-OR-6]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2026-04-13","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"OR"}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T22:33:31+00:00","id":"hr5097-119","introducedDate":"2025-09-02","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2025-09-02","text":"Referred to the House Committee on Agriculture."},"laws":[],"number":"5097","originChamber":"House","policyArea":"Agriculture and Food","sponsors":[{"bioguideId":"V000129","district":22,"fullName":"Rep. Valadao, David G. [R-CA-22]","party":"R","state":"CA"}],"summaries":[{"actionDate":"2025-09-02","actionDesc":"Introduced in House","text":"<p>This bill directs the Agricultural Marketing Service to establish a grant program for commercial specialty crop producers to acquire equipment and provide related training.</p><p>Funds must be used for mechanized or automated systems and tools that increase the efficiency of a task or reduce human labor for a specific activity (e.g., low-dust harvesting tools and equipment, sorting machines, and crop monitoring and analytics equipment and tools).</p><p>The bill includes a minimum 50% cost-sharing requirement.</p>","updateDate":"2025-09-11T21:04:54Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"To amend the Agricultural Marketing Act of 1946 to direct the Secretary of Agriculture to establish a program under which the Secretary will award grants to specialty crop producers to acquire certain equipment and provide training with respect to the use of such equipment.","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-04-14T08:05:49Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-04-14T08:05:49Z"}
